    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.poster.avif?t=1739246614\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.webm?t=1739246614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.mp4?t=1739246614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wooden Battles 2 is the sequel to Wooden Battles. Build wooden forts, prepare your defences, organize offensive units, and watch as your wooden soldiers blast through enemy troops. The game features infantry, cannons, artillery, siege equipment, vehicles and aircraft from five historical periods, starting the the medieval age, and spawning through to the modern era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/9e4d4bd843ea32b23f85c483d7d0466e.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/399cce3f739499ea79d311c5fb3ed08d.avif?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/9ae85753c3a7900c912737a63c460a1a.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate resources, train troops, build and upgrade your army, capture territory from the enemy, and conquer the apartment in this grand strategy game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/8c205fab76745f64479ef2fe1da13d12.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own custom battles on the Steam Workshop with other players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.poster.avif?t=1739246614\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.webm?t=1739246614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/2f35066e76bf55d46c8f7b48088681d6.mp4?t=1739246614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wooden Battles 2 is the sequel to Wooden Battles. Build wooden forts, prepare your defences, organize offensive units, and watch as your wooden soldiers blast through enemy troops. The game features infantry, cannons, artillery, siege equipment, vehicles and aircraft from five historical periods, starting the the medieval age, and spawning through to the modern era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/9e4d4bd843ea32b23f85c483d7d0466e.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/399cce3f739499ea79d311c5fb3ed08d.avif?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/9ae85753c3a7900c912737a63c460a1a.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate resources, train troops, build and upgrade your army, capture territory from the enemy, and conquer the apartment in this grand strategy game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461440/extras/8c205fab76745f64479ef2fe1da13d12.webp?t=1739246614\" width=650 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own custom battles on the Steam Workshop with other players.</p>",
